<div class="section_content content" id="7683517_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any provision, section, subsection, paragraph, subparagraph, sentence or clause of this chapter is for any reason held to be invalid or unconstitutional by the decision of any court of competent jurisdiction, such decision shall not affect the validity of the remaining portions of this chapter.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
